        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Frogdoku</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hop, think, and leap your way across peaceful waters.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Frogdoku</i> is a 3D grid-based puzzle game where logic, planning, and spatial awareness are key. As Konna, a clever frog, your mission is to arrange lily pads into a viable path, then leap across them to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge logic with rhythm as you arrange lily pads into harmonious patterns that unlock your path. With stylized visuals, ambient sound, and fluid movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles start simple, but quickly evolve into intricate brain teasers where every move can lead to victory, or a splash! Inspired by the elegance of Sudoku and the movement logic of block puzzles, <i>Frogdoku</i> offers a rewarding challenge for puzzle enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐸 Rearrange lily pads to solve grid-based puzzles<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720260/extras/07d2eef317b80ff6b1ed1fd43c566c3f.poster.avif?t=1785187353\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720260/extras/07d2eef317b80ff6b1ed1fd43c566c3f.webm?t=1785187353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720260/extras/07d2eef317b80ff6b1ed1fd43c566c3f.mp4?t=1785187353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌼 A gentle difficulty curve that grows into serious challenge<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720260/extras/803cedfa2cb6bbb641214d3c1b01fc00.poster.avif?t=1785187353\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720260/extras/803cedfa2cb6bbb641214d3c1b01fc00.webm?t=1785187353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720260/extras/803cedfa2cb6bbb641214d3c1b01fc00.mp4?t=1785187353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 3D stylized environments that mimic the coziness of 2D illustration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720260/extras/83932af66d37b5358e0d647f747244fa.poster.avif?t=1785187353\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720260/extras/83932af66d37b5358e0d647f747244fa.webm?t=1785187353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720260/extras/83932af66d37b5358e0d647f747244fa.mp4?t=1785187353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 Relaxing music and soundscapes from peaceful wetlands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 Minimalist UI and serene visuals for a calm experience</p></li></ul>",
